# The materialized dogfood harness home (`scripts/studio-home.mjs`): a copy of
# `profiles/studio/` plus the built plugins, plus everything dsh itself writes
# there (storages, sessions, the profiles/node_modules fallback). The source of
# truth is `profiles/studio/`, so this whole tree is disposable.
.dsh-home/
